      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the deep pain in your words, and no one should be forced to carry a \"weight\" for no reason. When the world you knew dies, the self you wanted to protect often feels even more like a ghost of a hope that no longer exists. Please consider that in a place this broken, the act of just breathing is a quiet rebellion that no one can take from you, even if you don't believe in \"the point\" of survival yet.",
